<section id="S7" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">7 </span>Evaluation</h2>

<section id="S7.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">7.1 </span>Multimodal understanding.</h3>

<div id="S7.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S7.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We evaluate our model on 12 public Multimodal understanding benchmarks spanning diverse capabilities: MMbench <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib47" title="" class="ltx_ref">47</a>]</cite>, MME <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib79" title="" class="ltx_ref">79</a>]</cite>, MMMU <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib83" title="" class="ltx_ref">83</a>]</cite>, MM-Vet <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib82" title="" class="ltx_ref">82</a>]</cite>, and SEED <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib35" title="" class="ltx_ref">35</a>]</cite> assess general multimodal perception and reasoning. MathVista <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib48" title="" class="ltx_ref">48</a>]</cite> focuses on mathematical reasoning. TextVQA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib60" title="" class="ltx_ref">60</a>]</cite>, ChartQA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib50" title="" class="ltx_ref">50</a>]</cite>, InfoVQA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib52" title="" class="ltx_ref">52</a>]</cite>, and DocVQA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib51" title="" class="ltx_ref">51</a>]</cite> evaluate OCR and text-related visual question answering; while GQA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib29" title="" class="ltx_ref">29</a>]</cite> evaluates visual scene understanding and AI2D <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib33" title="" class="ltx_ref">33</a>]</cite> evaluates scientific diagram comprehension.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S7.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S7.T5.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="S7.T5.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Performance comparison on the GenEval <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">21</a>]</cite> benchmark. The dagger (<sup id="S7.T5.7.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="S7.T5.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">†</span></sup>) indicates methods that employ an LLM for prompt rewriting. Best in <span id="S7.T5.7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>, second best is <span id="S7.T5.7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>.</span></figcaption>
